### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "ZooAnimalCrossingRoadAtNight" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1, :actor2, :actor3 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 .

:actor1 a :Cyclist ;
    :description "Cyclist on roadside path" .
:actor2 a :Cyclist ;
    :description "Cyclist crossing road in background" .
:actor3 a :Cyclist ;
    :description "Cyclist sitting in roadway" .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Large elephant statue blocking road" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition ;
    :description "Low-visibility nighttime scene with fog" .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential collision with cyclist sitting in roadway" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .
:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Large elephant statue obstructing forward visibility" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .
:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.80"^^xsd:float .
```

